    <detaileddescription>
<para>Linear kernel also knows as dot product kernel</para>
<para>Defined for two vectors <bold>x</bold> and <bold>y</bold>:</para>
<para><formula id="35">\[ K(\mathbf{x}, \mathbf{y}) = \mathbf{x}^T \mathbf{y} = \sum_i x^{(i)} y^{(i)} \]</formula></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classKern__Base" kindref="compound">Kern_Base</ref> <ref refid="structBF__Linear" kindref="compound">BF_Linear</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
